WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.020 --> 00:00:11.100
Let's pray together as we seek the Lord

2
00:00:11.940 --> 00:00:15.200
for the holiness that separates us from the common or the ordinary.

3
00:00:17.140 --> 00:00:21.000
Father, we come into your holy presence, and we give thanks to you

4
00:00:21.040 --> 00:00:21.960
for your great grace.

5
00:00:23.020 --> 00:00:26.840
You've been so good to us. We couldn't begin to thank or

6
00:00:27.020 --> 00:00:28.919
list every single blessing.

7
00:00:29.720 --> 00:00:33.590
But Lord, the overwhelming bounty of your

8
00:00:33.780 --> 00:00:34.640
goodness to us

9
00:00:35.480 --> 00:00:39.460
just makes us rejoice. Nothing we have is

10
00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:43.180
from our own skill, our own ability, our own right arm

11
00:00:43.320 --> 00:00:47.200
cannot save us. We thank you, Lord, that you have blessed us

12
00:00:47.220 --> 00:00:49.940
with all things that we need for life and godliness.

13
00:00:50.680 --> 00:00:51.160
But Lord,

14
00:00:52.020 --> 00:00:54.080
so many things in our lives, so many times,

15
00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:58.820
we just depend upon our own strength, and we treat everything in our

16
00:00:58.840 --> 00:01:01.040
life, we just assume that it's ours.

17
00:01:01.100 --> 00:01:04.761
We assume that everything we have belongs to

18
00:01:04.901 --> 00:01:08.720
us. Oh God, open our eyes and help us

19
00:01:08.760 --> 00:01:12.700
to see that there is nothing in the world, there is

20
00:01:12.840 --> 00:01:16.420
nothing in our lives, there's nothing in our family or our possessions or our

21
00:01:16.540 --> 00:01:20.220
time or our talents or our treasure that doesn't

22
00:01:20.260 --> 00:01:23.780
belong to you. So oh God, open our

23
00:01:23.880 --> 00:01:27.760
eyes. Open our minds to see everything

24
00:01:27.800 --> 00:01:31.520
like you see it in our lives. Oh God, would you help us to

25
00:01:31.580 --> 00:01:35.390
place willingly everything under the Lordship of Jesus

26
00:01:35.460 --> 00:01:39.020
Christ. If there's anything that we're not seeing clearly, that we're

27
00:01:39.200 --> 00:01:43.050
seeing as ordinary or common, oh God, would

28
00:01:43.080 --> 00:01:47.060
you help us to see it as holy? I pray, Lord, that you reveal

29
00:01:47.100 --> 00:01:50.420
things even now to me and to my prayer partner.

30
00:01:50.440 --> 00:01:54.340
Would you open our eyes to see what is really holy, to see

31
00:01:54.380 --> 00:01:57.630
what holiness is really like, and let us take

32
00:01:57.700 --> 00:02:01.340
everything that we once thought was common and realize it is

33
00:02:01.380 --> 00:02:03.980
dedicated, it must be dedicated to you.

34
00:02:04.160 --> 00:02:07.840
Thank you, Lord, for taking all those things and making them holy.

35
00:02:08.760 --> 00:02:12.420
We pray that you'd bless us with the knowledge of your holiness and how to live it

36
00:02:12.480 --> 00:02:13.699
out. In Jesus' name.

37
00:02:15.180 --> 00:02:17.620
Let's continue seeking and praying together.
